nnen de verwachtingen van de Russische adel wanneer zij verliefd wordt op een man die niet haar echtgenoot is. Haar keuze brengt de verhoudingen in haar omgeving en haar eigen bestaan onder druk. De roman verbindt haar ervaringen met andere levens en laat verschillende opvattingen over liefde, huwelijk en plicht naast elkaar bestaan. Zo wordt zichtbaar hoe persoonlijke verlangens botsen met sociale en morele oordelen.","work_id":977100057,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/129679/anna-karenina.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789025301583 verschijningsdatum 31/01/2017 NUR 302 Vertaalde literaire roman, novelle imprint Athenaeum - Polak & van Gennep uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sha256":"c02023a21148607bdc7bc050ae379d7a7a11c4ac9188c14459a3605c56452095","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:12:24.213Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Lev Tolstoi"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/129679/anna-karenina.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-07-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":977300031},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":977100101},"seq":7,"relation":"works","after_row":{"id":977100101,"title":"Schemerleven","cover_id":null,"author_id":977300032,"work_type":null,"source_type":"lumiscore_native","open_library_id":null,"first_publish_year":2022,"native_identity_key":"nl-reviewed-isbn:9789044549874"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":977200145},"seq":8,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":977200145,"title":"Schemerleven","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789044549874","work_id":977100101,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200145},"seq":9,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":977100101,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1571744/schemerleven.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789044549874 verschijningsdatum 07/10/2025 NUR 301 Literaire roman, novelle imprint De Geus uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sha256":"7bd0ce3158d17c5eb597ea7386aa6cf8b2e566c30648207f85b6717b0c7364e9","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:09:24.660Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Jaap Robben"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000718783_Schemerleven_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet6","bytes":142242,"sha256":"c3e7890b57367a53b58377f56d68f3048a4b0fbea1bf0ca20c192fa00886b936","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:20:41.341Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000718783_Schemerleven_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200145,"bound_title":"Schemerleven","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789044549874","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1571744/schemerleven.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-07-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"nld","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":977300032},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100101,"language":"nl"},"seq":10,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Op een winterdag in 1963 ontmoet de jonge Frieda Tendeloo op de bevroren Waal de getrouwde Otto. Hun verliefdheid krijgt een ingrijpend vervolg, waarover zij daarna jarenlang zwijgt. Wanneer Frieda op haar eenentachtigste opnieuw alleen komt te staan, laten die herinneringen zich niet meer wegdrukken. De roman volgt haar zoektocht naar wat zij verloor en naar een manier om het verzwegen deel van haar leven onder ogen te zien.","work_id":977100101,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1571744/schemerleven.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789044549874 verschijningsdatum 07/10/2025 NUR 301 Literaire roman, novelle imprint De Geus uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sha256":"7bd0ce3158d17c5eb597ea7386aa6cf8b2e566c30648207f85b6717b0c7364e9","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:09:24.660Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Jaap Robben"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1571744/schemerleven.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-07-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":977300032},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":977100102},"seq":11,"relation":"works","after_row":{"id":977100102,"title":"Jij mag alles zijn","cover_id":null,"author_id":930300048,"work_type":null,"source_type":"lumiscore_native","open_library_id":null,"first_publish_year":2021,"native_identity_key":"nl-reviewed-isbn:9789044649192"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":977200146},"seq":12,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":977200146,"title":"Jij mag alles zijn","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789044649192","work_id":977100102,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Prometheus, Uitgeverij","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200146},"seq":13,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":977100102,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1457232/jij-mag-alles-zijn.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789044649192 verschijningsdatum 03/09/2021 NUR 200 Kinderboeken algemeen imprint Prometheus uitgever Prometheus, Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sha256":"a59d921937460b18f0eb0f03483bb5ddf330c695e39759f81624d8af9e3e5adc","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:13:13.783Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Griet Op de Beeck"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000693979_Jij_mag_alles_zijn_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet6","bytes":156293,"sha256":"d230b60bb52f3b637f19df6baa918a79c5c26aed7e2e9fccb99696dbd94d5345","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:20:42.660Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000693979_Jij_mag_alles_zijn_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200146,"bound_title":"Jij mag alles zijn","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789044649192","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1457232/jij-mag-alles-zijn.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-07-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"nld","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":930300048},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100102,"language":"nl"},"seq":14,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"De negenjarige Lexi ziet op oude foto''s hoe anders het leven van haar ouders vroeger leek. In haar eigen dagelijks bestaan spelen verdriet en zorgen een grote rol. Ze probeert dapper te doen wat zij denkt dat de volwassenen van haar nodig hebben, ook wanneer dat veel van haar vraagt. Door haar blik onderzoekt het verhaal de verhouding tussen ouders en kinderen en de vraag hoeveel verantwoordelijkheid een kind voor andermans geluk kan dragen.","work_id":977100102,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1457232/jij-mag-alles-zijn.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789044649192 verschijningsdatum 03/09/2021 NUR 200 Kinderboeken algemeen imprint Prometheus uitgever Prometheus, Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sha256":"a59d921937460b18f0eb0f03483bb5ddf330c695e39759f81624d8af9e3e5adc","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:13:13.783Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Griet Op de Beeck"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1457232/jij-mag-alles-zijn.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-07-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":930300048},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":977100103},"seq":15,"relation":"works","after_row":{"id":977100103,"title":"De koning zonder paard","cover_id":null,"author_id":977300033,"work_type":null,"source_type":"lumiscore_native","open_library_id":null,"first_publish_year":2025,"native_identity_key":"nl-reviewed-isbn:9789000406784"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":977200147},"seq":16,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":977200147,"title":"De koning zonder paard","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789000406784","work_id":977100103,"cover_id":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Uitgeverij Unieboek | Het Spectrum","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":null},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200147},"seq":17,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":977100103,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2115967/de-koning-zonder-paard.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789000406784 verschijningsdatum 20/10/2026 NUR 281 Fictie 4-6 jaar 273 Prentenboeken ( imprint Van Holkema & Warendorf uitgever Uitgeverij Unieboek | Het Spectrum taal Nederlands","sha256":"3af5782b135951234eb44d898db781644370ed9dc2e16f19bb468160f0b1162a","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:09:30.123Z","identityNote":"2026 enlarged illustrated edition with fold-out page of the2025 reading-campaign story; same narrative identity, not a second Work. Not automatically taste-test approved.","sourceAuthors":"Levina van Teunenbroek"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000803398_De_koning_zonder_paard_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet6","bytes":1004829,"sha256":"f90a1252a69dbd721375a5876a23a61a5f8e8b06f675754246fb2b50bbb9a8eb","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:20:43.984Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000803398_De_koning_zonder_paard_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200147,"bound_title":"De koning zonder paard","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789000406784","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2115967/de-koning-zonder-paard.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-07-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"nld","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":977300033},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100103,"language":"nl"},"seq":18,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Wanneer de koning naar de stallen gaat, blijkt zijn paard verdwenen. Buiten het kasteel ontdekt hij een slapende draak en hoort hij uit diens buik het vertrouwde gehinnik. Om zijn vriend terug te krijgen, moet hij zijn angst overwinnen en een ongewoon reddingsplan uitvoeren. Dit prentenboek vertelt over moed en vriendschap. De uitgebreide uitgave voegt illustraties en een uitklappagina toe aan het verhaal dat eerder voor de Kinderboekenweek verscheen.","work_id":977100103,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2115967/de-koning-zonder-paard.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789000406784 verschijningsdatum 20/10/2026 NUR 281 Fictie 4-6 jaar 273 Prentenboeken ( imprint Van Holkema & Warendorf uitgever Uitgeverij Unieboek | Het Spectrum taal Nederlands","sha256":"3af5782b135951234eb44d898db781644370ed9dc2e16f19bb468160f0b1162a","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:09:30.123Z","identityNote":"2026 enlarged illustrated edition with fold-out page of the2025 reading-campaign story; same narrative identity, not a second Work. Not automatically taste-test approved.","sourceAuthors":"Levina van Teunenbroek"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2115967/de-koning-zonder-paard.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-rev