eruggebracht naar Narnia, maar herkennen het land nauwelijks. Hun vroegere kasteel is vervallen en de sprekende dieren worden onderdrukt door koning Miraz. Van de dwerg Trumpkin horen ze wat er sinds hun vertrek is gebeurd. Prins Caspian zoekt steun om de heersende macht te weerstaan. De kinderen raken opnieuw betrokken bij een strijd om de toekomst van een wereld die zonder hen verder is gegaan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1423229/prins-caspian.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1423229/prins-caspian.html","sha256":"adda16c646268711aa1711ed2c74e8a4140a8f2415b81b415d83968c2b746039","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:15:12.174Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789026610592 verschijningsdatum 01/01/2001 NUR 283 Fictie 10-12 jaar imprint Callenbach uitgever VBK Media taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"C.S. Lewis , Chris Staples Lewis","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024558704","key":{"edition_id":977200014},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":977200014,"work_id":977100007,"bound_author_id":8800015,"bound_title":"Mes van dromen","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789024558704","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000214261_Mes_van_dromen_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/479822/mes-van-dromen.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/479822/mes-van-dromen.html","sha256":"59cd1e1afdb31305276b5c95c3e13c71fd966bb39f74566d287eefcb93fa1e11","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:15:14.35